WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.306
The 2010s.

00:00:01.306 --> 00:00:03.386
Pipeline Politics and MAID.

00:00:03.386 --> 00:00:05.193
Afghanistan combat mission ends.

00:00:05.193 --> 00:00:09.136
Pipeline battles rage between provinces and the federal government.

00:00:09.136 --> 00:00:15.659
MAID is legalized in 2016 with Bill C-14, then expanded with Bill C-7.

00:00:15.659 --> 00:00:20.397
The foreign interference crisis begins to surface through CSIS intelligence leaks.
